{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1528022-immortal-hobbies","id":1528022,"title":"Immortal Hobbies","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-01-05T07:49:19-08:00","id":1528022,"title":"Immortal Hobbies","content":"I saw a Tumblr post about what would you do if you were immortal, and which hobbies people would have.<br /> <br /> Now, I have a persistent idea of a Ventrue breeding animals during centuries for aesthetic or intellectual pleasure, I paraphrse the post: &quot;<i>This is Arnaldo, 5th generation Grey Parrot of my breeding program, he can do basic multiplication now</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> There was an example posted of a doing extraordinarily complex and/or large handcrafts, as you have enough time to see it to completion.<br /> <br /> Which other weird hobbies would you think Vampires would have? Could you provide examples? I would love to use them ingame.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-06T05:08:34-08:00","id":1528098,"title":"","content":"IIRC 2e torpor causes Elders who wake up to have an easy time picking up new skills or information, which could easily extend to picking up modern hobbies. Sure the initial assumption is to go for something big and grand, but that's not the only option. After all VtM Ventrue were established to be fond of Chess.<br /> <br /> I can see the Invictus as having a big historical wargaming scene. They play out campaigns simulating one day every night with a complex web of politics and alliances. Their models are meticulously painted, I get the image of a Ventrue carefully applying highlights as they give orders to their favourite ghoul. It doesn't even have to be a recent thing, it's entire reasonable for them to have picked up military games shortly after their invention and may well have their own rules by now.<br /> <br /> Vampires, despite their inhumanity, are people. Some will do big and impressive things, some will make you go 'but why'. And some, like the one who spends six decades making a 28mm scale recreation of the entirety of 18th century Paris, will do both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-07T18:42:51-08:00","id":1528192,"title":"","content":"Anything to pass the time such as knitting, painting, manipulating the lives several mortal-families for generations, or simply scratching in a mark on the local subway stone every time they walk by; There's a lot of marks on there. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TwoDSix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1528022-immortal-hobbies?p=1528098#post1528098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">. . .<br /> <br /> I can see the Invictus as having a big historical wargaming scene. They play out campaigns simulating one day every night with a complex web of politics and alliances. Their models are meticulously painted, I get the image of a Ventrue carefully applying highlights as they give orders to their favourite ghoul. It doesn't even have to be a recent thing, it's entire reasonable for them to have picked up military games shortly after their invention and may well have their own rules by now.<br /> . . .</div> </div> </div> </div>I like V:tM, Sabbat's hobbies, such as dominating mortals in thinking they are monsters in a sewer and the Sabbat goes in and hunts them like D&amp;D. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-08T02:45:44-08:00","id":1528206,"title":"","content":"Puppet Play From The Invictus Book<br /> <br /> For a more elaborate game of social manipulation, Invictus members sometimes engage in Puppet Play. A single Invictus proposes to maneuver a group of mortals into acting out a drama of her design, without them knowing it. Typically, the undead dramatist has a month in which to move her mortal puppets. If she cannot create the situations she promised, she loses face but suffers no other penalty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27472-phoenix853457","name":"Phoenix853457","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27472_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-08T07:49:36-08:00","id":1528213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phoenix853457</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1528022-immortal-hobbies?p=1528206#post1528206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Puppet Play From The Invictus Book<br /> <br /> For a more elaborate game of social manipulation, Invictus members sometimes engage in Puppet Play. A single Invictus proposes to maneuver a group of mortals into acting out a drama of her design, without them knowing it. Typically, the undead dramatist has a month in which to move her mortal puppets. If she cannot create the situations she promised, she loses face but suffers no other penalty.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now I'm imagining a Ventrue with Nightmare doing the movie &quot;Cabin in the Woods&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-08T13:24:15-08:00","id":1528222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phoenix853457</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1528022-immortal-hobbies?p=1528206#post1528206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Puppet Play From The Invictus Book<br /> <br /> For a more elaborate game of social manipulation, Invictus members sometimes engage in Puppet Play. A single Invictus proposes to maneuver a group of mortals into acting out a drama of her design, without them knowing it. Typically, the undead dramatist has a month in which to move her mortal puppets. If she cannot create the situations she promised, she loses face but suffers no other penalty.</div> </div> </div> </div>So that's why celebrity flings happen!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T10:40:32-08:00","id":1528332,"title":"","content":"I would probably take up a sport like basketball or soccer to play to pass the time and get hopefully decent at it. Later I might take up a musical career like playing drums or a guitar for a short lived band.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-11T16:09:24-08:00","id":1528401,"title":"","content":"For certain vampires, I could imagine they might assume alter egos to cut loose to Pennsylvania (because it sounds like Transylvania and we all know that sounds <i>cool</i>) and infiltrate a township posing as your average American yankee-doodle-dandy, taking over a local bar and grill after the previous owner disappears!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23800-the-firebrand","name":"The Firebrand","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23800_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-12T10:19:45-08:00","id":1528418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>the firebrand</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1528022-immortal-hobbies?p=1528401#post1528401\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">for certain vampires, i could imagine they might assume alter egos to cut loose to pennsylvania (because it sounds like transylvania and we all know that sounds <i>cool</i>) and infiltrate a township posing as your average american yankee-doodle-dandy, taking over a local bar and grill after the previous owner disappears!</div> </div> </div> </div>wow jack daytonaaaaa","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12210-ulisses","name":"Ulisses","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-12T16:57:37-08:00","id":1528459,"title":"","content":"I think it would be interesting to take a hobby they had when they were human &amp; twist it. Could be something like say an &quot;armchair detective&quot; whose hobby was watching murder shows &amp; reading mystery novels \u2014 but as a vampire they can\u2019t experience it the same way &amp; thus the enjoyment is gone. As a vampire they can only enjoy that hobby when they create their own murder mystery with some unsuspecting human pawn. Or maybe an avid gardener as a human can only get that hobby back with carnivorous plants or smthg.<br /> <br /> I had more I was gonna say but my original post was consumed by the void.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27935-trynmybest","name":"trynmybest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27935_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-13T06:39:43-08:00","id":1528483,"title":"","content":"Hoax And Venery From The Invictus Book<br /> <br /> The Kindred constantly need to cover up evidence of their activities, often creating false explanations for Masquerade breaches. The Invictus turns this into a sport. In a game of Hoax<br /> <br /> Venery is an archaic term for hunting. The term has become a metaphor for lechery and seduction. The Kindred find both senses appropriate when they hunt mortals for sport, since the Kindred prefer social skills to brute force.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27472-phoenix853457","name":"Phoenix853457","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27472_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-14T13:44:47-08:00","id":1528564,"title":"","content":"It's interesting that the hobbies so far have skewed very Invictus, particularly the ones from the books. I'm sure it's not beyond us to come up with ideas for the other Covenants.<br /> <br /> Although honestly I can see most Covenants having an equivalent to Hoax.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-14T15:23:20-08:00","id":1528568,"title":"","content":"I can imagine the Circle's hobbies look much like Sabbat ones from WoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-16T12:01:28-08:00","id":1528659,"title":"","content":"The Crucible For the circle of the Crone book:<br /> The basic concept is simple. The Acolyte chooses a target, and puts him through hell so that he can learn from the experience. Hence the name: metal is put through a furnace to refine it. The practice is rather more complex than that, however.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://christophedia.com/Repository/nWOD-COD/1E:%20Vampire%20-%20the%20Requiem/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://christophedia.com/Repository/nWOD-COD/1E:%20Vampire%20-%20the%20Requiem/\" target=\"_blank\"> Error 401 - Unauthorized </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://christophedia.com/Repository/nWOD-COD/1E:%20Vampire%20-%20the%20Requiem/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://christophedia.com/Repository/nWOD-COD/1E:%20Vampire%20-%20the%20Requiem/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27472-phoenix853457","name":"Phoenix853457","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27472_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-16T13:27:56-08:00","id":1528670,"title":"","content":"If I recall the members of the Crone are big on putting themselves through hardship to better themselves as adversity creates better quality people and this Covenant values the creative spark.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T00:11:29-08:00","id":1528875,"title":"","content":"In one session I made a treasure hunt Toreador Party, where a magick artifact was the prize.<br /> <br /> NY in my games has a roman circus where ghouls act as gladiators and duels between kindred happen. Some vampires behave as profesional ghoul trainers, others make bets, etc...<br /> <br /> There is also races and other kind of events.<br /> <br /> However having time for a hobby is rare in neonates as they have to fight for resources/blood and do not have much free time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24037-leandro16","name":"Leandro16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24037_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-28T19:23:15-08:00","id":1529628,"title":"","content":"I was thinking some Vampires might participate in De extinction, but I dont know how...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27385-cross-a-way","name":"Cross-a-way","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27385_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-29T09:24:52-08:00","id":1529649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cross-a-way</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1528022-immortal-hobbies?p=1529628#post1529628\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was thinking some Vampires might participate in De extinction, but I dont know how...</div> </div> </div> </div>I am imagining a very Daeva reasoning for animal de-extinction and conservation:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I want to pet one of each animal, and every year there are FEWER species, this can not do&quot;.</i><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":".  Grammar, text style. 01-29-2024, 12:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-29T16:30:18-08:00","id":1529672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1528022-immortal-hobbies?p=1529649#post1529649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am imagining a very Daeva reasoning for animal de-extinction and conservation:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I want to pet one of each animal, and every year there are FEWER species, this can not do&quot;.</i><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>And now i have a new thing for my Gangrel Arch-Kogaion to challenge itself with in his free time.<br /> <br /> &quot;So you're telling me the place where the russians found that frozen mammoth mummy is <i>haunted</i>? You know where to meet me tomorrow.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 01-29-2024, 07:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-29T19:44:12-08:00","id":1529684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_co